  /* <Function>                                                            */
  /*    tt_face_load_name                                                  */
  /*                                                                       */
  /* <Description>                                                         */
  /*    Loads the name records.                                            */
  /*                                                                       */
  /* <Input>                                                               */
  /*    face   :: A handle to the target face object.                      */
